5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need a fair system that doesn't destroy the harmony of the building. I suggest we look at the history of disputes and current usage.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I agree! I want to make sure everyone feels treated fairly. I'm worried some people might feel left out.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,We should focus on the physical reality of the parking area and how people actually use it daily to avoid chaos.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Let's be rational. We always talk about ""fairness"" but never about the actual money involved. I'll be checking the finances.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I am interested in the administrative burden. We should see how previous systems were managed and what the actual workload is.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shunichi, money is one factor, but social friction is more costly in the long run. We must avoid creating resentment.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Yumi,,@Asuka is right! I want to know if the current spots are actually being used by the people assigned to them.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Yumi, that's a good point. If we don't know who is actually riding, we are just guessing.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"Resentment is a vague metric, Asuka. I prefer numbers. I want to know exactly what the costs and collections look like.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,I agree with the need for data. I want to see the records of how things were handled in the past.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,pass,Asuka,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Yumi,,I'll look into the stickers and the daily riders to see the truth!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I will investigate the morning departures and the rain exposure. The physical layout is the root of the problem.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I'll stick to my plan. The ledger and the treasurer's files should tell us the real story.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I will examine the association minutes and the treasurer's handover file.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Asuka,,I will check the complaint log and the association minutes to see where things went wrong previously.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Yumi,,I'll also check the sticker register and the daily riders!,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
